From 4c2fa8c0bde46fa6e2c4b2932f6fc3dec4617c7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:33:08 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18c: route JavaScript dialogs to the host

Use the per-WebContents JavaScriptDialogManager for alert, confirm, prompt and beforeunload. Add deferred request/cancel events, single-use responses, and navigation/frame/close cancellation. Preserve conservative fallback without a host. ABI 1.18 / bridge 0.20.0. Build p54 and native dialogs host pass; full wave gates are recorded in WAVE-18C-REPORT.md.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
